BackedBy demo run on the DEMO registry (90 s contest window). Every line is a real Studio Dev transaction.

The log holds three appended runs: a first pass (21:58 UTC) cut short when public RPCs throttled Studio's shared
egress, the full run (22:52 to 00:04 UTC) that resumed from the pairs the first pass registered, and demo_extra.mjs,
which repeated the one step the throttling had answered instead of the contract.

Paths and where they are in this log:
  register (4 bridges)                      ## 1     fake pair refused on merit         ## 2 (again)
  add destination + duplicate refused       ## 3     bond x2                             ## 4
  challenge INCONCLUSIVE (before the bond)  ## 5     challenge BACKED, contest upheld    ## 7  (check 2)
  challenge UNDER_BACKED, slash + bounty    ## 8  (check 3)
  monitoring INCONCLUSIVE (gap 800 s)       ## 9  (check 4)
  timeout: unread check expires             ## 10 (check 5)
  monitoring FINAL x3                       ## 11 (checks 6, 7, 8)
  CollateralGate allow and refuse           ## 12 (allowed BACKED; refused UNDER_BACKED x2, stale, no such pair)
  unbond + withdraw                         ## 13    claims, ledger 0                    ## 14
Result: held_now 0, received 0.14 GEN = claimed 0.14 GEN, invariant true.

